`/data/ylwang/non-textfuzz/target/_audit_result/FFmpeg/report-drafts/libavcodec_hq_hqa_c__001.md` has been written with the full report. The vulnerability is a confirmed CWE-125 off-by-4 OOB read in `hq_decode_frame()` / `hqa_decode_frame()` where a stale `data_size` (measured before the 4-byte tag is consumed) causes the slice-end bounds check to allow `init_get_bits` to set up a buffer ending 4 bytes past the packet allocation.
